{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45403","headline":"短歌行 · 皎然","name":"短歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人若不死，吾亦何所悲。\n萧萧烟雨九原上，白杨青松葬者谁。\n贵贱同一尘，死生同一指。\n人生在世共如此，何异浮云与流水。\n短歌行，短歌无穷日已倾。\n邺宫梁苑徒有名，春草秋风伤我情。\n何爲不学金仙侣，一悟空王无死生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}